## 1. Purpose and scope

Improve the existing Classes & Students experience into a complete, secure, school-year-aware administrative workflow.

The system must support:

1. Creating anticipated classes before school registration begins.
2. Adding additional classes during registration or later in the school year.
3. Custom class names and labels without imposed naming conventions.
4. Owner-controlled class-creation privileges for Managers, Administrative Personnel and Teachers.
5. Registering and placing new students without requiring app accounts.
6. Assigning and removing responsible and additional Teachers.
7. Reusing existing student identities for placement, transfer, renewal and promotion.
8. Preserving academic and Attendance history when changing classes.
9. Allowing Parents and Students to request class changes during the school year.
10. Delivering requests to Manager and Administrative Personnel review workspaces.
11. Recording authorized decisions and notifying requesters.
12. Supporting individual entry and future CSV/XLSX imports using the same canonical operations.

This is an enhancement of KRISTOU's existing single-school architecture, not a new school-management platform.

